<name>MORIYA NAOYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUTA, HIDETO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORIYA, NAOYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIN CATERPILLAR MITSUBISHI LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FURUTA HIDETO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORIYA NAOYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUTA, HIDETO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORIYA, NAOYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A hydraulic control device for working machines which improves compound operability for working machines such as hydraulic shovels having a plurality of hydraulic actuators, wherein, in the control section, distributive flow quantities  gamma 1    gamma 6 for distributing an allowable flow quantity  beta  for a hydraulic pump are calculated on the basis of the manipulated variable for an operating tool and a control instruction is issued to an electromagnetic proportional pressure reducing valve to feed the distributive flow quantities to the hydraulic actuators.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un dispositif hydraulique de commande pour machines de travaux améliorant l'exploitabilité des pièces constituant ces machines, telles que les pelles hydrauliques à plusieurs actionneurs hydrauliques. En outre, dans la partie de commande, les quantités de débit de distribution  gamma 1 -  gamma 2 permettant de distribuer un volume de débit autorisé  beta  à une pompe hydraulique sont calculées sur la base de la variable manipulée d'un outil en fonctionnement. Une instruction de commande est donnée à une valve électromagnétique de réduction de pression proportionnelle pour amener le volume de débit de distribution aux actionneurs hydrauliques.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>